            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The brushless motor itself is durable because there are no brushes to wear. The weak point is the control board and receiver, which can fail from heat or power surges. Whether a failure is a cheap fix depends on the manufacturer still selling the part, so buy from brands with good parts support and a strong electronics warranty."
          }
        },
